#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:81
msgid ""
"Enter the full path of a folder on this server, for example "
"/home/you/public_html."
msgstr ""
"Introduce la ruta completa de una carpeta de este servidor, por ejemplo "
"/home/you/public_html."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:93
msgid ""
"Its parent folder doesn’t exist. Create the folders above it first, or pick "
"an existing folder."
msgstr ""
"Su carpeta superior no existe. Crea primero las carpetas por encima, o elige"
" una carpeta existente."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:97
msgid ""
"Use letters, digits, dots, dashes and underscores for the new folder’s name."
msgstr ""
"Usa letras, dígitos, puntos, guiones y guiones bajos para el nombre de la "
"nueva carpeta."

#. translators: %s: folder path the site's account lives in.
#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:107
#, php-format
msgid "Pick a folder inside this hosting account (%s)."
msgstr "Elige una carpeta dentro de esta cuenta de hosting (%s)."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:113
msgid ""
"That is WordPress’s own folder. The static site needs a folder of its own."
msgstr ""
"Esa es la propia carpeta de WordPress. El sitio estático necesita una "
"carpeta propia."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:117
msgid ""
"That folder is inside WordPress. Pick the folder WordPress is in, or a "
"folder beside it."
msgstr ""
"Esa carpeta está dentro de WordPress. Elige la carpeta en la que está "
"WordPress, o una carpeta junto a ella."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:122
msgid ""
"WordPress is several folders below that one. Pick the folder WordPress is "
"directly in, or a folder beside it."
msgstr ""
"WordPress está varios niveles por debajo de esa carpeta. Elige la carpeta en"
" la que está WordPress directamente, o una carpeta junto a ella."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:135
msgid "That folder holds another WordPress site."
msgstr "Esa carpeta contiene otro sitio WordPress."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:143
msgid "Another destination already publishes into that folder."
msgstr "Otro destino ya publica en esa carpeta."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:153
msgid ""
"PHP can’t write to that folder. Check its permissions, or ask your host."
msgstr ""
"PHP no puede escribir en esa carpeta. Revisa sus permisos o consulta a tu "
"proveedor de hosting."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:236
msgid "Couldn’t create the folder."
msgstr "No se pudo crear la carpeta."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:239
msgid "Couldn’t write to the folder."
msgstr "No se pudo escribir en la carpeta."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:277
msgid ""
"Enter the address the folder is served at (Destination URL) so Test can "
"check it."
msgstr ""
"Introduce la dirección en la que se sirve la carpeta (URL de destino) para "
"que Probar pueda comprobarla."

#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:287
msgid "Couldn’t write a test file into the folder."
msgstr "No se pudo escribir un archivo de prueba en la carpeta."

#. translators: 1: Destination URL, 2: error.
#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:300
#, php-format
msgid "Couldn’t open %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "No se pudo abrir %1$s: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: Destination URL, 2: HTTP status code.
#: src/Deploy/ServerFolder.php:304
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s doesn’t serve this folder yet (a test file came back as HTTP %2$d). "
"Point the domain at the folder in your hosting panel, or correct the "
"Destination URL."
msgstr ""
"%1$s aún no sirve esta carpeta (un archivo de prueba devolvió HTTP %2$d). "
"Apunta el dominio a la carpeta en tu panel de hosting, o corrige la URL de "
"destino."

#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:68
msgid "This is a multisite network, which can’t be moved this way."
msgstr "Esta es una red multisitio, que no se puede mover de esta forma."

#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:71
msgid "WordPress has already been moved. Undo that move first."
msgstr "WordPress ya se ha movido. Deshaz primero ese traslado."

#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:77
msgid ""
"WordPress is installed in its own directory (its files and its address are "
"in different folders). Move it by hand instead."
msgstr ""
"WordPress está instalado en su propio directorio (sus archivos y su "
"dirección están en carpetas distintas). Muévelo a mano."

#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:80
msgid "WordPress isn’t at the root of its domain."
msgstr "WordPress no está en la raíz de su dominio."

#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:84
msgid "WordPress’s folder isn’t the folder this domain serves."
msgstr "La carpeta de WordPress no es la carpeta que sirve este dominio."

#. translators: %s: folder name.
#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:88
#, php-format
msgid "A file or folder named “%s” already exists next to WordPress."
msgstr "Ya existe un archivo o carpeta llamado «%s» junto a WordPress."

#. translators: %s: slug.
#: src/Deploy/WordPressMove.php:92
#, php-format
